<title>USA: Venturian Corp Q1 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Venturian Corp Q1 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>HOPKINS, Minn. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>(000's omitted, except per share data)</p>
<p>								1997     1996</p>
<p> Net sales						$6,743   $6,783</p>
<p> Gross Profit					    1,902    2,090</p>
<p> Operating profit (loss)			     (844)	257</p>
<p> Other income (expense)				 (52)	 22</p>
<p> Earnings (loss) before income taxes	     (896)	279</p>
<p> Income taxes						 --	  7</p>
<p> Net earnings (loss)				   (896)	272</p>
<p> Net earnings (loss) per share		    (1.19)	.36</p>
<p> Weighted average shares outstanding		 750	748</p>
<p>NOTE: Venturian's Napco International Inc subsidiary reported operating loss of $213,000 in Q1 1997 vs operating profit of $429,000 in Q1 1996.</p>
<p>Venturian Software Inc subsidiary posted Q1 1997 operating loss of $488,000 vs loss $31,000 in Q1 1996.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
